One of the best fps-rpg I ever played.

Good things:
- Has a lot of variety( weapons, characters, enemys, bosses, skills, and etc);
- Hillarious scenes and very interesting character;
- Good story and has a lot of easter eggs;
- A LOT OF FREAKING LOOT, this is the most rewarding thing in the game;
- Co-op games are awesome, especialy when you are playing with someone with a different class;

Bad things:
- It can get a little repetitive, cause most of the missions consists in going somewhere and kill everybody in there;
- Some bosses have very low drop rate for good guns.

